1630
02:25:32,708 --> 02:25:35,042
52 kilos.

1631
02:25:50,458 --> 02:25:51,667
¿Flavia?

1632
02:25:53,458 --> 02:25:54,958
Doctor Fernando.

1633
02:25:55,625 --> 02:25:57,375
Un placer conocerle.

1634
